(982, 1, '2026-03-16 07:02:08', '2026-03-16 07:02:08', '<b>Vina 커튼 인테리어 생산 주식회사</b>\r\n\r\n<em><strong>커튼 제공 전문 - 나무 바닥 - 벽지 - 카펫</strong></em>———————————————————————————————-\r\n\r\n쇼룸: No. 313 Cong Hoa Street, Ward 13, Tan Binh District\r\n\r\n연중무휴 상담전화 : 0982.743.888\r\n\r\n이메일: vinaremhcm@gmail.com<div class=\"content-after-post\">\r\n\r\n<strong>————————————————————</strong>\r\n\r\n<strong>VINARM – 매력적인 공간</strong>\r\n<strong>공장:</strong> 호치민시 Tan Phu District Tay Thanh Ward Truong Chinh 873<strong>페이스북:</strong> <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/Vinaremvn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://www.facebook.com/Vinaremvn</a>\r\n\r\n<strong>나뭇가지:</strong>– 호치민: 313 Cong Hoa, Ward 13, Tan Binh District\r\n– 다낭: 208 Dien Bien Phu, Chinh Gian Ward, Thanh Khe District\r\n– Can Tho: 25 Vo Van Kiet, An Hoa Ward, Ninh Kieu District\r\n– 푸꾸옥: M76, Sunset Town, Group 10, Quarter 6, An Thoi Ward\r\n– 하노이: Room 1401 Pacific Building No. 83b, Ly Thuong Kiet, Hoan Kiem District<strong>핫라인: 0915 892 895</strong>\r\n\r\n</div>', '클래식 퍼플 2레이어 패브릭 커튼', '<ul class=\"elementor-icon-list-items\">\r\n 	<li class=\"elementor-icon-list-item\"><span class=\"elementor-icon-list-text\">고품질 표준 커튼</span></li>\r\n 	<li class=\"elementor-icon-list-item\"><i class=\"icon icon-minus\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i><span class=\"elementor-icon-list-text\">100% 진정한 헌신</span></li>\r\n 	<li class=\"elementor-icon-list-item\"><i class=\"icon icon-minus\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i><span class=\"elementor-icon-list-text\">전국 무료시공</span></li>\r\n 	<li class=\"elementor-icon-list-item\"><i class=\"icon icon-minus\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i><span class=\"elementor-icon-list-text\">발생하는 액세서리의 A-Z 지원</span></li>\r\n 	<li class=\"elementor-icon-list-item\"><i class=\"icon icon-minus\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i><span class=\"elementor-icon-list-text\">전국보증</span></li>\r\n</ul>', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'ko-classic-purple-2-layer-fabric-curtain', '', '', '2026-03-16 07:02:08', '2026-03-16 07:02:08',